{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:ModelsOfQous.CategoricalArchimedeanBridge","@type":"LeanModule","name":"ModelsOfQous.CategoricalArchimedeanBridge","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Basic","lean:module:QOU.QuantumObservableUniverse.CategoricalFoundations","lean:module:Mathlib.CategoryTheory.Monoidal.Category","lean:module:Mathlib.CategoryTheory.Functor.Basic"],"declarations":11,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.categorical_archimedean_bridge","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.categorical_archimedean_bridge","kind":"theorem","line":60,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/models-of-qous/categorical-archimedean-bridge.lean#L60-L67","doc":"The bridge identity: the fibre functor sends the categorical\nvertical-projected differential to the geometric contact operator. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:categorical-archimedean-bridge","label":"prop:categorical-archimedean-bridge","md":"quantum-observable-universe/models-of-qous/categorical-archimedean-bridge.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalArchimedeanBridge.bridge","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalArchimedeanBridge.bridge","kind":"theorem","line":58,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/models-of-qous/categorical-archimedean-bridge.lean#L58-L58","doc":"**Bridge identity**: `τ(π_V ≫ d) = θ ∧ ℒ_ξ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalArchimedeanBridge.contactOp","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalArchimedeanBridge.contactOp","kind":"def","line":56,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/models-of-qous/categorical-archimedean-bridge.lean#L56-L56","doc":"The geometric contact operator `θ ∧ ℒ_ξ` on `τ(A)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalArchimedeanBridge.fibreFunctor","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalArchimedeanBridge.fibreFunctor","kind":"def","line":54,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/models-of-qous/categorical-archimedean-bridge.lean#L54-L54","doc":"The fibre functor `τ : C → D`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalArchimedeanBridge.catD","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalArchimedeanBridge.catD","kind":"def","line":52,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/models-of-qous/categorical-archimedean-bridge.lean#L52-L52","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalArchimedeanBridge.D","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalArchimedeanBridge.D","kind":"def","line":51,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/models-of-qous/categorical-archimedean-bridge.lean#L51-L51","doc":"The geometric target category (e.g. smooth manifolds). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalArchimedeanBridge.d_classical","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalArchimedeanBridge.d_classical","kind":"def","line":49,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/models-of-qous/categorical-archimedean-bridge.lean#L49-L49","doc":"The classical differential `d`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalArchimedeanBridge.proj_V","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalArchimedeanBridge.proj_V","kind":"def","line":47,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/models-of-qous/categorical-archimedean-bridge.lean#L47-L47","doc":"The vertical projection `π_V` from the weight decomposition. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalArchimedeanBridge.frobHopf","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalArchimedeanBridge.frobHopf","kind":"def","line":45,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/models-of-qous/categorical-archimedean-bridge.lean#L45-L45","doc":"The Frobenius–Hopf object `A` in `C`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalArchimedeanBridge.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalArchimedeanBridge.mk","kind":"ctor","line":42,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/models-of-qous/categorical-archimedean-bridge.lean#L42-L42","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalArchimedeanBridge","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalArchimedeanBridge","kind":"structure","line":29,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/models-of-qous/categorical-archimedean-bridge.lean#L29-L58","doc":"**Categorical–geometric correspondence**.\n\nGiven a quantum observable universe with weight decomposition\n`π_H, π_V` and categorical q-exterior derivative `d_q`, the fibre\nfunctor `τ` intertwines the categorical vertical projection with\nthe geometric contact operation:\n\n`τ(π_V ∘ d) = θ ∧ ℒ_ξ : Ωᵏ(M) → Ωᵏ⁺¹(M)`.\n\nThis is encoded as a commutative square: applying the fibre functor\nto the categorical `π_V ≫ d` yields the same morphism as the\ngeometric `θ ∧ ℒ_ξ` on the realised manifold. ","signatureChunk":0}]}